          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Expert florists at Growing Wild design each piece of <em>Artificial flowers </em>by hand. Based on exactly what you want, using premium materials that actually look alive. Not those shiny plastic things from craft stores that scream \"fake.\" Real artistry that makes your neighbor do a double-take.</p><h3><strong>Why busy people choose us:</strong></h3><ul><li>Lasts forever, never embarrasses you</li><li>Made custom so it actually fits your space</li><li>No maintenance, no guilt, no dying</li><li>Handcrafted with care</li></ul>"
