          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Real-looking artificial flowers give you day one beauty forever. Your home looks good every single day, not just the days between flower shop trips and throwing dead ones away. Perfect for people whose to-do lists are already drowning them.</p><p>What they do for you:</p><ul><li>Look beautiful when you wake up and when you go to sleep</li><li>Never make you feel guilty for forgetting them</li><li>Stop the \"should I buy flowers today\" mental loop</li><li>Always ready when your mother-in-law surprises you</li></ul>"
