        "richtext_Y8PDaF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Visit our online store and show us a photo of your entryway that feels empty. Tell us about your dining room that needs <em>artificial flowers for a vase</em>​, but you're not sure what kind. We get it. Our service helps you out in each case.</p><p>What you get to control:</p><ul><li>Colors matching what you actually have, not Pinterest</li><li>Flower types that fit your vibe</li><li>Size that works in real life, not catalogs</li><li>Container style you'll actually like looking at</li></ul>"
