    "image_with_text_JMNYLX": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_FTHeDb": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Wedding & Outdoor Artificial Flowers That Survive Real Weather</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "richtext_LjhTgT": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Growing Wild designs outdoor artificial flowers that survive your real life. UV-resistant materials that handle the sun, weather, your sprinklers hitting them, and your kids' soccer balls.</p><p>Perfect<em> artificial flowers for outdoors</em> when you:</p><ul><li>Have better things to do than water plants</li><li>Keep killing everything you plant</li><li>Want your patio to look nice for spontaneous gatherings</li><li>Are you tired of empty planters staring at you</li></ul><p>Planning a wedding is stressful enough without worrying if your bouquet will wilt before the photos. Remember your friend's wedding where the centerpieces looked sad at the reception? Or that bride whose bouquet was drooping in every ceremony photo?</p><p><em>Artificial wedding flowers </em>give you one less thing to stress about. Why stressed brides choose artificial:</p><ul><li>Look perfect from getting ready through the last dance</li><li>Keep your bouquet without preserving services</li><li>No \"sorry, those aren't in season\" limitations</li><li>One less vendor thing to coordinate day-of</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
